TbY-dv4QPwimBl3G0va90TBh3Mq2v25l9v0_1yRA&oe=69A17EDB"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "1103455960295054", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035326_1103455966961720_7616357045042388556_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yIV3BIGzCzAQ7kNvwEyR0md&_nc_oc=AdnM6571y-_gRocDviANvZSRQUs8RFut3lmNGUvUXrrG8aRj93LiJqqKypacN3QO7cs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsooxOTUifr2fnpf55eJeGNHC-KKTc288Sc7VNvsinegw&oe=69A19C5F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440-Landscape.png", "id": "838765437087449", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_838765440420782_7534785496759123227_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mB4K2Jj7_UMQ7kNvwG_PpGE&_nc_oc=Adm8w7Q9KmwEnZgtIN5mR7o_hBolgT94DvKB_LZ4wrs-viRC5DsyIEXD3XU00dn-7W4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsTtAEsUHjn53dwpFcXh8lDTsv-BWC2LzAZEZQusSBAWw&oe=69A17DF8"}, "display_name": "PRO Car Wash", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Time to chill with PRO CAR WASH! \nClean the cars with a pressure wash, complete tasks and relax.\nPro Car Wash is a car wash simulation game for virtual reality. Build your own car wash business. All cars will have its own unique challanges . Remove hard dirts, refill oil, and change battery. Earn Wash Coin and unlock new upgrades for your workshop. Complete satisfying challenges. \nJoin a relaxing adventure, cleaning will make you feel great for sure.\nKey Features! \n-Wash the cars with different challenges \n-Remove hard muds and dirts with different pressure washer nozzles.\n-Get your hand dirty! Remove garbage from cars. \n-Refill oil and change batteries. \n-Sell car scents or oil to your customers for more Wash Coin!\n-Upgrade your business with a better workshop. \nWhat is in the next update?\n-Military Car Pack \n-New Pressure Washers \n-Soap cleaner \n-Vacuum Cleaner for the inside of the cars \nand much more! \n", "short_description": "Ti